    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Months, seasons and dates",
     "texto": [
      "Months and seasons are written with a **capital letter** and the preposition **im**: **im Juli**, **im Sommer** (in summer), **im Winter**, **im Frühling** (in spring), **im Herbst** (in autumn).",
      "The date takes **am** and an ordinal number: **am dritten Dezember** (the third of December). Ordinals end in **-ten** up to 19 and in **-sten** from 20: **am ersten**, **am zweiten**, **am dritten**, **am vierten**… **am zwanzigsten**.",
      "In English too, you «have» a birthday: **Wann hast du Geburtstag?** (when is your birthday?)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
